# X710: gts9-power-key.service owns short presses (backlight only).
# GNOME 48 treats the Qualcomm vm-other chassis as a VM: every action except
# 'nothing' issues PowerOff, even if logind's HandlePowerKey is ignore.
# Keep kernel/PMIC long-hold recovery and the existing backlight helper intact.
[org.gnome.settings-daemon.plugins.power]
power-button-action='nothing'
